<title>USA: BOK Financial Corp Q3 net up.</title>
<headline>BOK Financial Corp Q3 net up.</headline>
<dateline>TULSA, Okla. 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr primary		$0.61		    $0.59</p>
<p> Shr diluted		$0.56		    $0.54</p>
<p> Net			 12,975		   12,493</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 Q3 results reduced by one-time charge of $3.8 million or $0.11/shr after tax for Savings Association Insurance Fund recapitalization. Excluding the charge, earnings were $14.2 million or $0.61/shr diluted in the Q3 and $40.8 million or $1.75/shr diuted for the nine months.  </p>
<p>	 9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr primary		$1.87		    $1.72</p>
<p> Shr diluted		$1.69		    $1.57</p>
<p> Net			 39,561		   36,542</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Assets $4.47 billion vs $4.10 billion</p>
<p>Deposits $3.24 billion vs $2.73 billion</p>
<p>Loans $2.27 billion vs $2.07 billion</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
